''This page is part of the [[VCT/2026/Americas League/Stage 2|VCT 2026: Americas Stage 2]] article.''

==Format==
* '''Group Stage:''' July ''16<sup>th</sup>'' - August ''9<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Two Single-Round Robin Groups
*** Each Group has 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} from each group advance to ''Playoffs''
*** {{Bgcolortext|seedup|Winners}} have a bye into the ''Upper Bracket Semifinals''
*** {{Bgcolortext|up|2<sup>nd</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Upper Bracket Round 1''
*** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|3<sup>rd</sup> & 4<sup>th</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Play-Ins Upper Bracket Round 2''
*** {{Bgcolortext|stay|5<sup>th</sup> & 6<sup>th</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Play-Ins Upper Bracket Round 1''

